font family---> changes font (can download and install from google fonts)
font weight---> used to change thickness of fonts
text decoration---> used to decorate text
font size--> must be kept in 'vw' to make responsive website
line hieght--->used to adjust hieht between many lines
text-align--->used to align text/paragraph (has many options like centred,left,right,justify,etc.)
padding---> used to align text and give space from every corner
  parent is padded
  everything inside element/with element gets shifted
margin--->gives space between two elements
  only used between more than a element(two)
--for padding and margin one,two,three and four values can be given to adjust from all direction.

border--->used to create border outside a element/div
  syntax:
  border: width type color;
 ->border radius: used to round an element/div.
   after circle no more element is cut.

