  * block element covers whole line and dont allow any other element after it. block has rule-one element one space.
  * in-line elemnts says if there is space you can add other element. it does not allows to increase width or hieght.
  -->in-line block: to solve the problem a block is declared in-line which helps to adjusts more elemts in a line with allowing changes in width and hieght.
  
  
